# 统一全平台行尾为 LF：Windows CI runner 的 Git 默认 core.autocrlf=true，
# 会在 checkout 时把 LF 转成 CRLF，导致 oxfmt --check 误报格式不符。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Preserve byte-identical upstream SQLite ABI headers, including upstream whitespace.
packages/persistence/native/sqlite/* linguist-vendored -whitespace

# Preserve authored Markdown hard breaks in the immutable supplied design snapshot.
docs/design/game-runtime-multigame-v0.4.md whitespace=-blank-at-eol
